# Chats = app pages

**Mental model:** Work on a page → open a chat with that page’s name. Pick the model once. Prefer a fresh chat when the slice is done (1 active chat is fine; don’t run a farm of agents at once).

Paste starters from `.cursor/agents/`.

**Product name:** Do not hardcode the product brand in chat titles. Chat names are area-only (`Home`, `Pipeline`, …). If the product renames, update display copy in the app — not every agent file.

