## Slack later

Name bots simply: Pricing, Triage, Security, Print, Ship — see `.cursor/agents/slack-*.md`.

## Rules

- One page (or one money domain) per chat.
- New work → matching page chat (fresh is fine). Avoid days-long mega-chats.
- Model sticks for that conversation after you pick it.
- Stay in-scope for the chat’s starter; don’t wander into other pages unless required.
